WEBVTT

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.810
He is currently in a sleep state.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.770
He wakes up sitting up cross-legged,

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:34.570
stays awake for a few hours,
then falls asleep for another 24 hours.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:35.990
It's all understandable.

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.490
His entire memory is gone, after all.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.700
How is he retaining new information
since getting resuscitated?

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:42.700
It's normal.

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:45.710
He has learned about
30 English words so far.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:50.840
However,
he does not comprehend his identity.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:53.880
Even his family…

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:58.390
He doesn't show any response,
even to his daughter's photos.

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:05.770
His brain waves and EKG are
within normal parameters.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:09.310
But his muscle mass has decreased.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:16.240
With all his memories gone,
he does not feel any reason to live,

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:20.410
causing the body to rapidly atrophy.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:23.870
What can we do, Doctor?

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.160
I cannot say.

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:30.630
His only chance of recovery might be
retrieving his memory.

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:34.630
Doctor, do not touch his head!

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:39.930
He got hurt!

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:40.850
We must treat him!

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:45.100
I'm sorry, Doctor. I forgot to warn you.

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.190
Did he use his Stand just now?

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:50.610
He did. However,
that wasn't from his consciousness.

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:53.480
It was just his instinctive bodily reflex
to defend.

00:01:57.110 --> 00:01:59.700
"Jo… Lyne."

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:00.870
"Jolyne"?

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:05.870
No… that's not possible.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.550
I've always…

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:22.470
I've always cared about you.

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.390
Something's going on with your cut.

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:32.230
It was fixed. I know I just filled it in.

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:36.940
It looks like some sort of writing,
doesn't it?

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:39.240
Should I try to fill it again?

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:40.490
Wait.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.780
Don't fill this one.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:47.540
I can't explain it, but…

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:48.910
I just know it.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.580
This is a message from my father.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:58.840
He's had so much to protect
even before I was born.

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:04.350
He was always away to keep dangers
like the one I'm in now

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:07.720
away from me and Mom.

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:12.350
I felt it, just now.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:16.520
My body tells me that
I understand my father now.

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:52.000
EPISODE 19: BIRTH OF THE "GREEN"

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:54.370
-Hey F.F.
-What?

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:57.960
Can you trip Jolyne down the stairs?

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.500
Just a little bit will do.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.340
Why would I do that?

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:06.380
I said, try to trip her.

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:09.760
We won't let her get hurt, of course.

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:13.730
I want to catch her from falling
with my own arms.

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:15.020
What?

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:20.770
Jolyne doesn't seem like
she understood that I saved her.

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:25.320
I want to embrace her tightly
one more time.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.530
Now, get to it.

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:30.160
-Trip her.
-Why don't you do it?

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:31.410
That's sexual harassment.

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:35.250
I already told you.
I'm going to marry Jolyne.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:40.500
And you promised to cooperate.
Or do you not keep your word?

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:45.210
Now, go do it.

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:51.180
I'm sorry, Jolyne.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:56.100
The small man!

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.310
He's right here!

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.770
He was spying on us from above!

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:04.780
Look! He has the bone in his hand!

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:19.290
This fucker sure moves in a funny way,
but he won't get away!

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:20.420
Hold it!

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.290
Do you see his back contorting?

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:31.340
You called him a small man.

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:33.890
It's true he fit the description earlier.

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:37.640
-But something strange is happening…
-Sunbathing…

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.730
Isn't he growing taller?

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:43.860
He's as tall as me,
no, he's taller than me now.

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:46.570
You have nowhere to run.

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.820
Turn around slowly.

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:51.740
The sunlight is nice and warm.

00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:52.910
Light is good.

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:56.040
I said turn around, you little shit!

00:06:58.540 --> 00:06:59.500
Bleh…

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:02.290
Bleh.

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:11.840
What the fuck is with him?

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:16.010
Light, bleh, warm.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:20.310
We are happy… as we gather around…

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:21.850
and it's warm.

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:23.310
Bleh.

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:30.740
What was that?

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:34.700
Did you see that stuff splatter?
He could be a Stand User!

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:36.200
Keep your distance.

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:37.660
It doesn't seem to be a Stand.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:41.540
I don't know what it is,
but we mustn't touch him.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.580
Where's the bone?

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:47.250
The bone he had earlier. Where is it now?

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:04.400
What the…

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:08.980
The other prisoners
have already fallen prey.

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:13.490
Those look like plants.
They're still growing.

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:17.450
What happened to them, and who did this?

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:20.790
What is the meaning of this?

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:27.920
Should I assume that it's a Stand ability?

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:29.590
This bone,

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:34.260
along with the power and some sort of will
that sprouted these plants…

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:37.260
It's as if they are trying to
give birth to something.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:42.930
It bloomed the flowers first,
then the plants matured.

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:44.890
They grew out at
the end of the person's life.

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:51.400
Now, what to do with this bone
that the man dropped…

00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:56.860
Merely touching this bone
or anyone who grabbed it

00:08:56.950 --> 00:08:58.530
can be dangerous, after all.

00:09:00.490 --> 00:09:02.910
Don't take another step, Jolyne Cujoh!

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.960
Stop right there!

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:10.960
Show me your face.

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:13.170
Turn around.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:20.510
-What?
-It's nothing.

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:23.310
I want to take a moment to
check something.

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:34.400
What the hell is wrong with you?

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:36.240
Let go of her, asshole!

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:38.700
F.F., you stay silent.

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:43.120
The bone transformed the prisoners
in the Disciplinary Wing into that state.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.000
It can't be an enemy Stand,

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:48.670
since that would have
targeted us from the start.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.340
And if I'm not mistaken, Jolyne,

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:57.300
I think I saw your thread touching
that bone when it was still in his grasp.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.730
The bone! It's rolling away!

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:17.240
She's infected!

00:10:17.320 --> 00:10:18.860
Jolyne!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.490
But how?

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.870
Diver Drive!

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:28.790
Yes!

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:32.920
Weed them all out from the inside, quick!

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:35.460
There's more!

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:36.760
Why did you stop?

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:41.140
I wouldn't exactly say they're growing out
of her or that they need to be rooted out.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:44.310
Rather, her body itself
is transforming into plants.

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:47.020
Is it safe to pull them out?

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:48.600
Jolyne, does it hurt?

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:51.440
No.

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:54.940
I guess I did touch that bone.

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:59.280
Anyway, you should stay away from me
now that I'm infected.

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:01.450
It might spread to you.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:11.420
These are just plants,
nothing more, nothing less.

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.000
I can't tell what species they are,

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:17.760
but its stems are filled
with chlorophyll, not blood.

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:22.390
Either way,
I'll take care of it. I promise.

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:34.560
The sunlight!

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:36.360
Get in the shade.

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:38.730
If you touch sunlight
or move toward the light,

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:40.490
the plants will grow rapidly.

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:43.740
Step farther into the shade,
and the plants recede.

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:47.370
Damn, what does it want?

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:52.120
I can't say,
but I still need to get that bone.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:53.710
And just how will you do that?

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:57.500
If you hold the bone,
you'll turn into a plant, Jolyne!

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:59.340
I will pick it up.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:02.260
I'm already becoming a plant.

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:09.180
Don't go where
the sunlight touches, Jolyne!

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:12.270
The bone… Where is it?

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:14.650
Where can it be?

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:18.480
I thought I saw it rolling
towards this flower.

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:22.450
A star shape?

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:25.160
What is this bruise-like mark?

00:12:25.990 --> 00:12:28.870
It's see-through.
There's something else underneath.

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:32.540
A child…

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:35.540
It's a green child!

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:43.970
STAND NAME: YA-YA MA
STAND MASTER: D AN' G

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:46.050
What is it shaped like?

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:52.180
Carrots that look like Snoopy,
breast-shaped radishes, and other shapes

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:54.390
are found all the time during harvests.

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:56.560
This is just like those.

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:00.360
It really just resembles a child.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:05.990
It's alive! Impossible!

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:09.700
Jolyne, forget about it and come back!

00:13:09.780 --> 00:13:11.160
Haven't you noticed?

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:14.370
Your legs are turning too.
They are attaching to the vines!

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:20.290
What is this thing?
Is it a plant, or is it a human?

00:13:20.380 --> 00:13:22.420
It turned the prisoners
in the Disciplinary Wing into plants,

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:24.840
joined their roots, and became a fruit!

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:30.220
The bone must have gotten
implanted inside this fruit.

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:34.810
Pale Snake is at this prison
to discover what lies beyond this point.

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:37.390
What will it spawn?

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:40.940
He wants to know
what transpires when it is born.

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:43.480
I told you to come back, Jolyne.

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:47.280
The sun is moving westward,
causing more sunlight to enter.

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:49.700
You must move further back.

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:53.540
Are you taking that with you?

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:57.250
We call this seizing by force, F.F.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:00.540
I will not let Pale Snake have it.

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:02.590
Come, Jolyne.

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:05.090
We must move opposite the sun's direction.

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:07.880
Anastasia.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:10.510
This wing's entrance is to the west.

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:13.140
We'll never leave this shitty place
if we go east.

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:18.270
There's at least one other Stand User
somewhere in this wing.

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:25.070
Escape, huh.

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:34.580
Help me, please.

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:37.330
Someone help!

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:38.870
Please!

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:43.090
After everyone drowned, they turned
into plants and died! How horrible!

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:44.710
I'm begging you!

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:47.920
I don't want to turn into a plant!
Please, get me out of here!

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:49.130
Fine.

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:52.340
What's your name? Are you hurt?

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:56.140
What are you saying, Anastasia?
He could be our enemy.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:59.600
Are they right? Are you against us?

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:01.980
I don't know what you are talking about.

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:03.480
My name is Guccio.

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:07.070
I just don't want to turn into a plant!

00:15:08.740 --> 00:15:12.780
Calm down. I said it's fine.

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:16.120
Stand up, Guccio.
Surely you can do that much.

00:15:17.660 --> 00:15:19.200
Now hurry it up.

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:27.090
Do you know this?

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:31.880
A human has 12 pairs of ribs,
or 24 bones in total.

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:36.760
Whether a man or a woman, tall or short,
we all have the same number of ribs.

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:40.390
Good. Now go.

00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:47.360
I guess he wasn't our enemy after all.

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:49.820
I couldn't care less either way.

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:52.200
I'm only interested

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:56.280
in safely leaving through
the east side of this building.

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:57.830
Isn't that right?

00:15:57.910 --> 00:15:59.950
The keyword is "safely."

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.170
Let's leave from there.

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:11.630
A green child…

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:17.140
I wasn't told about any of this,

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:20.470
but my job is simple.

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:24.650
Finish off Jolyne Cujoh.
Just that, and nothing more.

00:16:24.730 --> 00:16:26.560
I will merely complete my assignment.

00:16:31.610 --> 00:16:32.570
Where are they?

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:35.160
Where did Jolyne Cujoh
and her two allies go?

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:38.120
Have they already left the building?

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:42.660
No, they cannot leave without me knowing.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.870
Hey you, what are you doing there?

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:49.040
Hey, I'm talking to you.

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:50.960
Where did those three go?

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:53.470
And how did you manage
to avoid becoming a plant?

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:02.770
Walk… outside…

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:05.560
-Save me…
-How terrible.

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:08.360
Someone restructured his body
into a human trap!

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:21.450
Fuck, it hurts!

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:28.210
Mommy, it hurts!

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:30.960
I don't want this shitty arm anymore!

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:33.960
I got screwed.

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:37.590
I'm only here
because Pale Snake ordered me

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:40.890
to cause a fight in here
with my Survivor Stand.

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:43.390
But forget that now.

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:46.100
I'm finally outside now.

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:50.360
GUCCIO
STAND NAME: SURVIVOR - BEYOND RECOVERY

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:58.530
Anyway, it looks like we got away
from the other Stand User.

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:03.580
The plants withered away.
I guess it was a temporary bloom.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:06.910
The problem is that it's about time
for someone from the prison

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.040
to realize the abnormalities
going on in the Disciplinary Wing.

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:11.250
That works in our favor.

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:16.170
Once that happens,
then Pale Snake will realize it too.

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:17.720
He will appear close to us.

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:21.760
This is the best chance yet of
getting my father's disc back.

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:27.270
Jolyne, watch out!

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.820
Stone Ocean!

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.490
It's an enemy Stand!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:47.370
He must belong to that
gladiator-looking man!

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:48.750
He swallowed the fruit!

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:50.330
I won't let them have it!

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:53.920
Asshole!

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:57.760
Diver Drive!

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:05.720
What is up with his body?

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:08.770
He stinks… really bad!

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:13.020
Go deeper, please!

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:16.070
-Shit, my Stand can't enter it!
-Punish me more, please!

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:18.940
I can feel it through my Stand!

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:21.860
My body's starting to stink
from the inside!

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:24.320
Those shoes of yours.

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:28.700
Did my bodily liquid dirty them?
I am very sorry.

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.750
Now please, come sit on this chair.

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:36.920
Let me lick your shoes clean.

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:40.720
Would you like this comic book?
I lifted it from the guards' break room.

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:43.090
Careful, there's a bee.

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:47.470
My master is named D an' G.

00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:50.230
The last I saw of him,
he was in the Disciplinary Wing.

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:54.310
His right arm got ripped off
and he was crying for his mommy.

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:01.240
It's a remotely controlled Stand!

00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:04.320
He wants to take the fruit to his User!

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:07.910
Shit, they've noticed.
The guards are coming!

00:20:07.990 --> 00:20:10.620
Jolyne, we must leave for now.

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:12.080
Let's go toward the wetlands.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:14.750
There must be a water bike
or a boat somewhere close.

00:20:19.550 --> 00:20:22.260
This is how to tell wild
strawberries apart.

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:26.220
The ones with yellow flowers
are mock strawberries, so don't eat them.

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:27.970
Shut your annoying trap.

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:30.930
We can't leave this Stand alone.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:35.190
We need to find a way to get
that green child out of its belly.

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:36.360
I know that.

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:39.900
F.F., we have no choice but to take it.

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:43.360
We'll leave you to find its User
and finish him off.

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:44.610
Got it.

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:48.830
Oh, you want me to go with you, Master.

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:59.040
This boat here is built specifically
for the wetlands, Master.

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:03.920
It has a propeller engine,
and it uses wind to propel forward.

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:07.050
Shit, how do I start the ignition?

00:21:07.140 --> 00:21:09.140
Is there a lock somewhere?

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:12.720
It's a throttle lever, Master.

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:16.690
Usually, it must be put
in neutral first, like this.

00:21:19.900 --> 00:21:22.150
This stick is for steering.

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:24.570
Push it forward to turn
the empennage to the right,

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:28.030
and pull the stick back
to turn it to the left.

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:30.910
-Release the tether.
-Yes, Master.

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:41.000
Jolyne, do not take your eyes off
that Stand.

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:52.390
While it's in your sight,
it'll act like an obedient servant.

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:54.730
Though creepy,
it will prove useful to you.

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:56.850
But turn your back on it
for a second, and…

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:06.610
Fuck…

00:22:07.110 --> 00:22:09.280
Who would have thought that was an attack?

00:22:09.360 --> 00:22:11.740
Jolyne, Anastasia…

00:22:12.240 --> 00:22:14.750
Don't let it out of your sight!

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:46.290
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
